 fish Tetraodon nigroviridis reveals the early vertebrate proto-karyotype.</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2004</year><volume>431</volume><fpage>946</fpage><lpage>957</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15496914</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nature03025</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brent</surname><given-names>MR</given-names></name><name><surname>Guigo</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Recent advances in gene structure prediction.</article-title><source>Curr Opin Struct Biol</source><year>2004</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>264</fpage><lpage>272</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15193305</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.sbi.2004.05.007</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Burset</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Guigo</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evaluation of gene structure prediction programs.</article-title><source>Genomics</source><year>1996</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>353</fpage><lpage>367</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8786136</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1006/geno.1996.0298</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bajic</surname><given-names>VB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparing the success of different prediction software in sequence analysis: a review.</article-title><source>Brief Bioinform</source><year>2000</year><volume>1</volume><fpage>214</fpage><lpage>228</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11465033</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/bib/1.3.214</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Baldi</surname><giv